          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The founding president of Aga Khan University, Dr Kassim-Lakha, has been conferred the Sitara-i-Imtiaz by the president of the government of Pakistan. "
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Sitara-i-lmtiaz, one of the country's highest civil awards, recognises his sustained and eminent services in the fields of education and healthcare."
            },
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
